{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46871","headline":"湖上逸人 · 齐己","name":"湖上逸人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"澹荡光中翡翠飞，田田初出柳丝丝。\n吟沿绿岛时逢鹤，醉泛清波或见龟。\n七泽钓师应识我，中原逐鹿不知谁。\n秋风水寺僧相近，一径芦花到竹篱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46871.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46871","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}